    "q-134616": {
      "dom_id": "question-134616",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find the measure of the exterior angle $\\omega .$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $\\omega =$  \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        ${}^{∘}$",
      "worked_solution": "The angle $\\omega $ is the sum of the measures of the exterior angles of a regular octagon and a square.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14194609/assets/2586359b460d4e4ce0324b21caa9328f1d319ebdefa5f7118aaa4719973cb79d.png)\n\n \n\nFor any polygon, the exterior angles sum to ${360}^{∘}.$ In a regular octagon, there are $8$ equivalent exterior angles, so each has a measure of \n\n$$\n\\frac{{360}^{∘}}{8}={45}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nLikewise, in a square, there are $4$ equivalent exterior angles, so each has a measure of \n\n$$\n\\frac{{360}^{∘}}{4}={90}^{∘}.\n$$\n\nSo, since the shaded angle is the sum of the measures of exterior angles of a regular octagon and a square, it must have a measure of\n\n$$\n{45}^{∘}+{90}^{∘}={135}^{∘}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "",
          "tag": "mathquill",
