    "q-134617": {
      "dom_id": "question-134617",
      "name": null,
      "problem": "Find the perimeter of the entire figure.\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                                \n\n                                        \n                                        \n                                        \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $p=$  \n\n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        $cm$",
      "worked_solution": "The perimeter $p$ of a polygon is the sum of the measures of all its sides.\n\nSince there are $24$ sides in total, and sides of the given figure are equal with length $5\\,cm$, we have \n\n$$\np=24\\cdot 5=120\\,cm.\n$$",
